1
00:00:00,770 --> 00:00:01,993
Top of her class.

2
00:00:01,883 --> 00:00:03,760
Eleven drafts to say 'hey'.

3
00:00:03,950 --> 00:00:05,120
Explain that.

4
00:00:06,110 --> 00:00:06,624
Easy.

5
00:00:06,514 --> 00:00:08,160
She's not into him.

6
00:00:08,250 --> 00:00:09,600
She's pinned his chat.

7
00:00:09,740 --> 00:00:10,656
…Fair point.

8
00:00:10,546 --> 00:00:12,470
But I don't think it's him.

9
00:00:15,860 --> 00:00:16,570
Cancelled again?

10
00:00:16,660 --> 00:00:17,867
Rescheduled.

11
00:00:17,757 --> 00:00:18,690
Thursday.

12
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:20,550
He always has a thing.

13
00:00:20,890 --> 00:00:22,171
I know, I know.

14
00:00:22,061 --> 00:00:22,874
Thursday.

15
00:00:22,764 --> 00:00:25,840
I'll be so on time it'll be insulting.

16
00:00:25,980 --> 00:00:27,730
He's on time for the voice note.

17
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:31,159
Don't look at me.

18
00:00:31,049 --> 00:00:33,510
I'm a hallucination brought on by revision.

19
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:35,770
Hallucinations don't bring tea.

20
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:39,253
Straight cuts are for people who've given up.

21
00:00:39,143 --> 00:00:39,770
You said.

22
00:00:41,860 --> 00:00:44,410
You go quiet right before you get brilliant.

23
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:45,992
Everyone likes you.

24
00:00:45,882 --> 00:00:47,810
It's weird you picked me.

25
00:00:47,900 --> 00:00:48,980
I didn't pick you.

26
00:00:48,870 --> 00:00:51,890
You were the only one in the library making that face.

27
00:00:53,280 --> 00:00:55,830
He's really there, when he's there.

28
00:00:55,920 --> 00:00:57,170
And when he isn't?

29
00:00:57,310 --> 00:00:58,660
…Refreshing a screen.

30
00:01:05,700 --> 00:01:07,470
That's nine times.

31
00:01:07,560 --> 00:01:08,210
Eight.

32
00:01:08,500 --> 00:01:09,230
…Nine.

33
00:01:09,620 --> 00:01:11,820
She flips it over like a lottery ticket.

34
00:01:11,910 --> 00:01:13,440
Not for the pizza app.

35
00:01:13,530 --> 00:01:18,671
There's a study where women who weren't sure a guy liked them were the most into him.

36
00:01:18,561 --> 00:01:20,092
Small, college students.

37
00:01:19,982 --> 00:01:20,980
Don't quote me.

38
00:01:21,070 --> 00:01:23,140
So she's hooked on not knowing.

39
00:01:23,330 --> 00:01:24,140
…Maybe.

40
00:01:24,180 --> 00:01:25,350
I'm quoting you.

41
00:01:28,940 --> 00:01:30,630
What has he actually done?

42
00:01:30,720 --> 00:01:32,570
He's figuring himself out.

43
00:01:33,160 --> 00:01:35,293
Potential never disappoints.

44
00:01:35,183 --> 00:01:36,522
It never cancels.

45
00:01:36,412 --> 00:01:39,990
It lives in a future where you wrote the ending.

46
00:01:40,580 --> 00:01:42,230
She's put months in.

47
00:01:42,270 --> 00:01:43,480
Sunk cost.

48
00:01:43,520 --> 00:01:45,130
Sunk cost with feelings.

49
00:01:45,220 --> 00:01:46,337
Hoping isn't dumb.

50
00:01:46,227 --> 00:01:50,030
Apparently couples do better when they see the best in each other.

51
00:01:50,120 --> 00:01:51,240
And when they don't?

52
00:01:51,330 --> 00:01:54,580
…Then you're drawing a nice picture of someone who isn't there.

53
00:01:55,370 --> 00:01:57,096
I don't think she wants him.

54
00:01:56,986 --> 00:01:59,290
I think she wants to be picked by him.

55
00:01:59,330 --> 00:02:00,280
Same thing.

56
00:02:00,370 --> 00:02:01,900
It really isn't.

57
00:02:04,090 --> 00:02:05,814
He sat with me till two a.m.

58
00:02:05,704 --> 00:02:07,140
before my presentation.

59
00:02:07,230 --> 00:02:08,046
I know.

60
00:02:07,936 --> 00:02:09,255
You told me.

61
00:02:09,145 --> 00:02:09,860
Twice.

62
00:02:09,950 --> 00:02:11,840
He never asked how it went.

63
00:02:13,030 --> 00:02:16,000
In all of these, he's asking me how it went.

64
00:02:16,890 --> 00:02:19,135
I keep drawing a guy who asks.

65
00:02:19,275 --> 00:02:20,025
Yeah.

66
00:02:20,615 --> 00:02:24,175
I wrote eleven drafts to someone who doesn't exist.

67
00:02:24,265 --> 00:02:25,055
Finally.

68
00:02:25,145 --> 00:02:26,045
Don't.

69
00:02:26,235 --> 00:02:26,945
…Finally.

70
00:02:31,635 --> 00:02:32,798
That's the girl.

71
00:02:32,688 --> 00:02:33,785
She looks okay.

72
00:02:33,875 --> 00:02:35,705
She hasn't checked her phone once.

73
00:02:35,795 --> 00:02:36,925
Is that a sign?

74
00:02:36,965 --> 00:02:37,995
…Of something.

75
00:02:38,785 --> 00:02:39,615
Who is it?

76
00:02:39,705 --> 00:02:40,655
Nobody.

77
00:02:40,745 --> 00:02:41,995
How many drafts?

78
00:02:42,185 --> 00:02:42,995
…Four.

79
00:02:43,235 --> 00:02:44,015
Krish.

80
00:02:45,305 --> 00:02:47,569
You're not waiting for their reply.

81
00:02:47,459 --> 00:02:49,415
You're waiting to feel chosen.
